<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ZENITH RTX • Jersey Tim</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
        body { background: #0b0c12; color: #e0e6f6; text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
        h1 { color: #4ec9ff; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #2586cc; }
        .jersey-container {
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #11141f 0%, #1b2233 100%);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 2rem 1.2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(62, 174, 242, 0.25);
            border: 1px solid #29426b;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .jersey-container::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -40%; left: -40%;
            width: 180%; height: 180%;
            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent, #2586cc33, transparent 25%);
            animation: putar 7s linear infinite;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        @keyframes putar { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .isi { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
        .logo { font-size: 2.3rem; font-weight: bold; color: #4ec9ff; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
        .slogan { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #89a0cb; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
        .nama-pemain { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; margin: .6rem 0; }
        .posisi { background: #223558; display: inline-block; padding: .2rem .8rem; border-radius: 12px; font-size: .9rem; color: #76d0ff; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .garis { height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2a8bdd, transparent); margin: 1rem 0; }
        ul { list-style: none; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #b0c4e8; }
        .keterangan { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: .9rem; color: #7a89a8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>👕 DESAIN JERSEY • ZENITH RTX</h1>

    <div class="jersey-container">
        <div class="isi">
            <div class="logo">🐺 ZENITH RTX</div>
            <div class="slogan">ONE TEAM • ONE VISION • ONE ZENITH</div>
            <div class="garis"></div>

            <div class="nama-pemain">APRI</div>
            <div class="posisi">🛡️ ROAM • KAPTEN</div>

            <div class="garis"></div>

            <p style="font-size:.85rem; color:#94a7cc;">Contoh juga berlaku untuk seluruh anggota:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>🏹 MIZU — Jalur Emas</li>
                <li>✨ OCTA — Jalur Tengah</li>
                <li>⚔️ CAIZ — Jalur Penyerang</li>
                <li>🌿 AYYASY — Penyerbu Hutan</li>
                <li>🏹 RICH • ⚔️ AFRY — Cadangan</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="keterangan">
        📌 Spesifikasi untuk dicetak: <br>
        • Warna Dasar: Hitam pekat & Biru Gelap<br>
        • Aksen: Biru Langit / Biru Bercahaya<br>
        • Bahan: Jaring halus, nyaman, cepat kering
    </div>

    <br><a href="index.html" style="color:#4ec9ff; text-decoration:none;">← Kembali ke Halaman Utama Tim</a>

</body>
</html>
